  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "This repository contains an [example WebAssembly host][example-host] written in Rust that can run components that implement the `adder` world.",
      "source_hash": 16032851722618948790,
      "context_hash": 2657681653321520948,
      "translation": "이 저장소에는 `adder` 월드를 구현하는 컴포넌트를 실행할 수 있는, Rust로 작성된 [예제 WebAssembly 호스트][example-host]가 포함되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "world": "월드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218130Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`git clone https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs.git`",
      "source_hash": 6909345413185799020,
      "context_hash": 2694666029659579008,
      "translation": "`git clone https://github.com/bytecodealliance/component-docs.git`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`cd component-docs/component-model/examples/example-host`",
      "source_hash": 8542437626043695697,
      "context_hash": 5426696694363488546,
      "translation": "`cd component-docs/component-model/examples/example-host`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`cargo run --release -- 1 2 <PATH>/adder.wasm`",
      "source_hash": 10413554175225148716,
      "context_hash": 11143929406258005743,
      "translation": "`cargo run --release -- 1 2 <PATH>/adder.wasm`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The double dashes separate the flags passed to `cargo` from the flags passed in to your code.",
      "source_hash": 12339685759304296415,
      "context_hash": 4888593676111109420,
      "translation": "이중 대시는 `cargo`에 전달되는 플래그와 여러분의 코드에 전달되는 플래그를 구분합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The arguments 1 and 2 are the arguments to the adder.",
      "source_hash": 8522450360441275723,
      "context_hash": 9000871890977926692,
      "translation": "인자 1과 2는 adder에 전달되는 인자입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "In place of `<PATH>`, substitute the directory that contains your generated `adder.wasm` file.",
      "source_hash": 13209049995252747203,
      "context_hash": 9432680901426472668,
      "translation": "`<PATH>` 대신, 생성된 `adder.wasm` 파일이 있는 디렉터리로 대체하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Note: When hosts run components that use WASI interfaces, they must *explicitly* [add WASI to the linker][add-to-linker] to run the built component.",
      "source_hash": 18206367098312913903,
      "context_hash": 9425501190807051040,
      "translation": "참고: 호스트가 WASI 인터페이스를 사용하는 컴포넌트를 실행할 때는, 빌드된 컴포넌트를 실행하기 위해 *반드시* [WASI를 링커에 추가][add-to-linker]해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:50:00.218131Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}